# LAUNCH-002 (ADR 0048, L2-5): every production secret, one per line.
#   <Secrets Manager name under divalhr/production/> | <file under $PROD_DATA/secrets> | <owner uid> | <generated | operator>
# generated: created by secrets-bootstrap.sh (random, 48 characters, never printed).
# operator:  supplied by the operator from the approved provider; never generated, never in Git.
# Production values are never copied from hr-dev: nothing here has an hr-dev counterpart in Secrets Manager.
# Not rotatable in place (a stored value is sealed or keyed with it): email-lookup, the webhook,
# messaging and payment encryption keys and the payment-submission and partner signing keys. See docs/OPS-PRODUCTION.md section 6.
